WEBVTT

00:14:56.871 --> 00:15:00.621
I wished to tell him that,
were he to acknowledge my disability,

00:15:00.662 --> 00:15:02.871
it would be OK,

00:15:02.871 --> 00:15:05.454
for people are wrong
to marvel at those like me

00:15:05.496 --> 00:15:07.204
who smile as we limp.

00:15:07.871 --> 00:15:11.704
People don't know that they
have lived through worse,

00:15:11.704 --> 00:15:12.954
that problems of the heart

00:15:12.996 --> 00:15:15.329
hit with a force
greater than a runaway truck,

00:15:15.329 --> 00:15:17.579
that problems of the mind
are greater still,

00:15:17.621 --> 00:15:20.287
more injurious
than a hundred broken necks.

00:15:22.204 --> 00:15:23.371
I wished to tell him

00:15:23.371 --> 00:15:26.246
that what makes most of us
who we are most of all

00:15:26.287 --> 00:15:28.454
is not our minds and not our bodies

00:15:28.496 --> 00:15:30.579
and not what happens to us,